  nesnd_civic_characters.18.t: "Accounts Across the Provinces"
  nesnd_civic_characters.18.d: "Jiang Shaoheng seeks public budget scrutiny of cross-province works and concentrated capital. Coastal profits, inland taxes and provincial educational places fall on different people; an aggregate total cannot settle their disputes."
