+ nesnd_civic_characters.118.t: "What the Provinces Give and Receive"
+ nesnd_civic_characters.118.d: "Jiang Shaoheng continues to seek scrutiny of cross-province investment in the budget. Coastal profits and inland taxes do not become ownerless when added together. Provincial delegates in the Assembly of Rites must still explain what their own provinces give and receive."
