  nesnd_civic_characters.200.t: "From Teacher to Provincial Delegate"
  nesnd_civic_characters.200.d: "The constitutional process has recognised practical and provincial qualifications, and Duan Jingchuan has met the corresponding examination requirements. The teacher can now participate as a provincial delegate in the Assembly of Rites, representing educational and public interests. Provincial administrative authority remains separate."
  nesnd_civic_characters.200.a: "Accept the qualification and its responsibilities."
